<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-New cogeneration power plant for S. Australia.</title>
<headline>RTRS-New cogeneration power plant for S. Australia.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A joint venture between CU Power Australia Pty Ltd, Boral Energy Ltd and ETSA Corp has been awarded exclusive rights to develop a new cogeneration plant at Mobil Corp's Adelaide refinery, Boral Ltd's Boral Energy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The development process will involve gas suppliers, financiers, electricity power companies, state and local authorities, it said. The new plant is expected to provide operating benefits to Mobil through the provision of cheaper steam and electricity, it said.  </p>
<p>CU Power is a unit of Canadian power group ATCO Ltd.</p>
<p>ETSA Corp is the South Australian state government's power utility.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
